<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><style>
{{{mkpdfsFontFaces "lora-source-sans"}}}
@page { size: A4 landscape; margin: 0; }
* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
html,body { width:297mm; height:210mm; font-family:'Lora',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; color:#1a1a1a; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; }
.page { width:297mm; height:210mm; position:relative; overflow:hidden; background:#fff; }
.f1 { position:absolute; top:6mm; left:6mm; right:6mm; bottom:6mm; border:2.5px solid #1f5fa8; }
.f2 { position:absolute; top:8.2mm; left:8.2mm; right:8.2mm; bottom:8.2mm; border:7px solid #6ccbe9; }
.f3 { position:absolute; top:11.4mm; left:11.4mm; right:11.4mm; bottom:11.4mm; border:1.5px solid #1f5fa8; }
.cor { position:absolute; z-index:4; width:22mm; height:22mm; }
.cor svg { width:100%; height:100%; }
.cor.tl { top:3.5mm; left:3.5mm; }
.cor.tr { top:3.5mm; right:3.5mm; transform:scaleX(-1); }
.cor.bl { bottom:3.5mm; left:3.5mm; transform:scaleY(-1); }
.cor.br { bottom:3.5mm; right:3.5mm; transform:scale(-1,-1); }
.content { position:absolute; top:13mm; left:18mm; right:18mm; z-index:5; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; text-align:center; }
.logo { height:21mm; width:auto; margin-bottom:2px; }
.addr { font-family:'Source Sans 3',sans-serif; font-size:10px; color:#444; margin-bottom:9px; border-bottom:1px solid #bbb; padding-bottom:5px; }
.diploma { font-size:42px; font-weight:800; color:#1f5fa8; letter-spacing:4px; margin-bottom:4px; }
.concedido { font-size:20px; color:#222; margin-bottom:8px; }
.name { font-size:30px; font-weight:800; color:#111; letter-spacing:0.5px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:12px; }
.lede { font-size:17px; color:#333; margin-bottom:8px; }
.course { font-size:30px; font-weight:800; color:#111; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:14px; }
.body { font-size:17px; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:225mm; }
.body .grade { font-weight:800; }
.sig-row { position:absolute; left:38mm; right:38mm; bottom:66mm; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; z-index:6; }
.sig { width:170px; text-align:center; }
.sig svg { display:block; margin:0 auto -4px; }
.sig-cap { font-family:'Source Sans 3',sans-serif; font-size:11px; color:#222; border-top:1px solid #444; padding-top:3px; }
.stamp { position:absolute; right:46mm; bottom:58mm; z-index:7; }
.legal { position:absolute; left:0; right:0; bottom:13mm; text-align:center; font-family:'Source Sans 3',sans-serif; font-size:9px; color:#555; z-index:6; }
.legal .l1 { font-style:italic; margin-bottom:3px; }
.dotline { position:absolute; left:24mm; bottom:70mm; font-family:'Source Sans 3',sans-serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:3px; color:#999; z-index:6; }
</style></head><body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="f1"></div><div class="f2"></div><div class="f3"></div>
  <div class="cor tl"><svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 120 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="7" y="7" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="#1f5fa8" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="12" y="12" width="18" height="18" fill="#e6f6fd" stroke="#1f5fa8" stroke-width="0.7"/><rect x="16" y="16" width="10" height="10" fill="#1f5fa8" transform="rotate(45 21 21)"/><circle cx="21" cy="21" r="2" fill="#fff"/><path d="M35 21 C58 21 64 33 84 28 C95 25 98 36 89 39 C84 41 81 35 86 33" fill="none" stroke="#6ccbe9" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M21 35 C21 58 33 64 28 84 C25 95 36 98 39 89 C41 84 35 81 33 86" fill="none" stroke="#6ccbe9" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M35 35 C50 50 66 54 80 52" fill="none" stroke="#a9def0" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M35 35 C50 50 54 66 52 80" fill="none" stroke="#a9def0" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="86" cy="33" r="2" fill="#6ccbe9"/><circle cx="33" cy="86" r="2" fill="#6ccbe9"/></svg></div><div class="cor tr"><svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 120 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="7" y="7" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="#1f5fa8" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="12" y="12" width="18" height="18" fill="#e6f6fd" stroke="#1f5fa8" stroke-width="0.7"/><rect x="16" y="16" width="10" height="10" fill="#1f5fa8" transform="rotate(45 21 21)"/><circle cx="21" cy="21" r="2" fill="#fff"/><path d="M35 21 C58 21 64 33 84 28 C95 25 98 36 89 39 C84 41 81 35 86 33" fill="none" stroke="#6ccbe9" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M21 35 C21 58 33 64 28 84 C25 95 36 98 39 89 C41 84 35 81 33 86" fill="none" stroke="#6ccbe9" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M35 35 C50 50 66 54 80 52" fill="none" stroke="#a9def0" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M35 35 C50 50 54 66 52 80" fill="none" stroke="#a9def0" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="86" cy="33" r="2" fill="#6ccbe9"/><circle cx="33" cy="86" r="2" fill="#6ccbe9"/></svg></div>
  <div class="cor bl"><svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 120 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="7" y="7" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="#1f5fa8" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="12" y="12" width="18" height="18" fill="#e6f6fd" stroke="#1f5fa8" stroke-width="0.7"/><rect x="16" y="16" width="10" height="10" fill="#1f5fa8" transform="rotate(45 21 21)"/><circle cx="21" cy="21" r="2" fill="#fff"/><path d="M35 21 C58 21 64 33 84 28 C95 25 98 36 89 39 C84 41 81 35 86 33" fill="none" stroke="#6ccbe9" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M21 35 C21 58 33 64 28 84 C25 95 36 98 39 89 C41 84 35 81 33 86" fill="none" stroke="#6ccbe9" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M35 35 C50 50 66 54 80 52" fill="none" stroke="#a9def0" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M35 35 C50 50 54 66 52 80" fill="none" stroke="#a9def0" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="86" cy="33" r="2" fill="#6ccbe9"/><circle cx="33" cy="86" r="2" fill="#6ccbe9"/></svg></div><div class="cor br"><svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 120 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="7" y="7" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="#1f5fa8" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="12" y="12" width="18" height="18" fill="#e6f6fd" stroke="#1f5fa8" stroke-width="0.7"/><rect x="16" y="16" width="10" height="10" fill="#1f5fa8" transform="rotate(45 21 21)"/><circle cx="21" cy="21" r="2" fill="#fff"/><path d="M35 21 C58 21 64 33 84 28 C95 25 98 36 89 39 C84 41 81 35 86 33" fill="none" stroke="#6ccbe9" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M21 35 C21 58 33 64 28 84 C25 95 36 98 39 89 C41 84 35 81 33 86" fill="none" stroke="#6ccbe9" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M35 35 C50 50 66 54 80 52" fill="none" stroke="#a9def0" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M35 35 C50 50 54 66 52 80" fill="none" stroke="#a9def0" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="86" cy="33" r="2" fill="#6ccbe9"/><circle cx="33" cy="86" r="2" fill="#6ccbe9"/></svg></div>
  <div class="content">
    <img class="logo" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Arenal Informática">
    <div class="addr">Arenal, 8, 3.ª planta - Tel. 91 532 67 10 - Fax: 91 523 43 85 - 28013 Madrid</div>
    <div class="diploma">DIPLOMA</div>
    <div class="concedido">Concedido a</div>
    <div class="name">{{recipientName}}</div>
    <div class="lede">que ha realizado, con aprovechamiento, el curso de:</div>
    <div class="course">{{courseName}}</div>
    <div class="body">Tras desarrollar el temario del curso, y una vez realizadas las prácticas correspondientes, ha demostrado un alto nivel de interés, superando las pruebas de aptitud, por lo que consigue un grado de <span class="grade">NOTABLE</span>.</div>
  </div>
